# liquibase/bin/lpm is a CLI tool bundled in the upstream liquibase base image,
# used only to install extensions interactively. It is never executed at runtime
# in the ECS task (which only runs `liquibase update`). These CVEs are in the Go
# stdlib that lpm was compiled against — not fixable by bumping the Liquibase
# version. Accept until upstream ships lpm recompiled against a patched Go runtime.
CVE-2024-24790
CVE-2025-68121
